stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Forecast: demand / PIR (Posture C) or ingested
  Forecast --> Planned: MPS/MRP emits planned order (or ingested planned order)
  Planned --> Firmed: planner firms quantity & dates
  Firmed --> Released: materials & capacity confirmed; order released to floor
  Released --> Scheduled: placed in finite-capacity sequence (M3b)
  Scheduled --> Dispatched: on the dispatch list for a work centre / shift
  Dispatched --> InProgress: operation started (run clock; confirmations begin)
  InProgress --> InProgress: per-operation confirmations (good/scrap/setup/time)
  InProgress --> Carried: open at shift end -> carried to next shift (M3a, no orphan)
  Carried --> InProgress: next shift resumes
  InProgress --> Completed: all operations confirmed; good qty booked
  Completed --> Closed: variances settled, costed, closed
  Planned --> Cancelled: demand drop / re-plan
  Closed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
